WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.001
The referee tablet (right) follows the scoresheet (left): score, serve, line-ups.

2
00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:15.215
"1 REF" / "2 REF" turns the court to the referee's side of the net.

3
00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:22.265
A time-out on the scoresheet: the tablet shows it and counts down.

4
00:00:23.894 --> 00:00:30.894
A substitution: the new player appears on the tablet.

5
00:00:32.057 --> 00:00:37.749
The tablet's menu: "Keep screen on" so it never turns off.
